meta {
  name: Weather by Coordinates
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  `GET /weather/coordinates`

  Get weather by geographic coordinates. The most accurate method for any
  location on Earth, since it bypasses name/geocoding ambiguity entirely.

  | Param       | Required | Default  | Notes                                  |
  | ----------- | -------- | -------- | -------------------------------------- |
  | `latitude`  | yes      | -        | Decimal degrees, -90 to 90             |
  | `longitude` | yes      | -        | Decimal degrees, -180 to 180           |
  | `units`     | no       | `Metric` | `Standard` \| `Metric` \| `Imperial`   |
  | `lang`      | no       | -        | Two-letter language code (`en`, `ja`)  |

  Responses are cached for one hour, keyed on all four parameters.
}
